        "text_MEwfJT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A new chapter begins for premium accessories from America’s leading brands — built for <strong>RAM, Silverado, F-Truck, Tundra, and GMC</strong> owners who demand more.</p><p><strong>America’s Garage</strong> is now <strong>powered by </strong><a href=\"https://outbackkitters.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://outbackkitters.com\"><strong>Outback Kitters</strong></a>, Australia’s dedicated team bringing world-class American vehicle accessories to our shores. We don’t just import boxes — we bring the full experience.</p><p>Products are <strong>test-fitted, proven, and supported locally</strong>, backed by real stock on hand, expert advice, and the knowledge that it works in Aussie conditions.</p><p>This is <strong>value-added distribution done right</strong> — by enthusiasts, for enthusiasts.</p>"
          }
        }
